Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Oushii explosion engine

Replaces the ray-sampled vanilla explosion with a block-grid blast field solved
directly in memory. Every block is visited at most once, and explosions that
detonate in the same tick within a small radius are merged.

This patch is Powered by Oushii(https://github.com/Paulem79/Oushii)

This patch is based on the following mixins:
* "net/paulem/mixin/PrimedTntMixin.java"
* "net/paulem/mixin/ServerLevelTickMixin.java"
By: Paulem
As part of: Oushii (https://github.com/Paulem79/Oushii)
Licensed under: GPL-3.0 (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html)

The engine deliberately does not reuse Level#explode, so the bridge re-fires
EntityExplodeEvent / BlockExplodeEvent / TNTPrimeEvent itself. The blast is
solved into a candidate set first, the events then get a chance to drop blocks
from it, and only the approved set is written to the world.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/PrimedTnt.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/PrimedTnt.java
index a6cc4d47d6613021700bd0764c492896626d6d16..e1580adaab21f1978563116c0b72b2728bc2f013 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/PrimedTnt.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/item/PrimedTnt.java
@@ -155,6 +155,19 @@ public class PrimedTnt extends Entity implements TraceableEntity {
                 return;
             }
             // CraftBukkit end
+            // Leaves start - Oushii explosion engine
+            // 锚点放在 ExplosionPrimeEvent 之后：TNT_EXPLODES 闸门、事件取消、getRadius()/getFire()
+            // 全部保持原版语义。引擎不支持点燃，因此 fire 为 true 时回落原版路径。
+            if (org.snowballmc.snowball.LeavesConfig.performance.explosionEngine && !event.getFire()) {
+                org.snowballmc.snowball.oushii.FastExplosionEngine.explode(
+                    level,
+                    new net.minecraft.world.phys.Vec3(this.getX(), this.getY(0.0625), this.getZ()),
+                    event.getRadius(),
+                    this
+                );
+                return;
+            }
+            // Leaves end - Oushii explosion engine
             this.level()
                 .explode(
                     this,
